    "text": "Let <math><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></math>, be a complex number, <math><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, such that <math><msup><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;is a real number. Then, the sum <math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to :",
