  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></math><br />Cubing both sides,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>)</mo><mi>i</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> <math><msup><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;a real number.<br /><math><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msup><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn><